    <string name="healer_granted_subtitle">Two days in a row completing your habits. Not bad.</string>
    <string name="healer_granted_explanation">A healer protects your overall streak if you ever forget to complete your habits: you activate it the next day, and that day counts as if you\'d done it. You can hold up to 1 healer at a time, and it doesn\'t replace what you do today — it just gives you room for one slip-up.</string>
